{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">理想汽車上月新車交付量逾3.1萬輛，按年跌幅百分之6.2，並較8月減少一成半。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">截至9月底，理想汽車歷來累計，交付183.3萬輛新車。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-02T00:39:52.270258+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":67,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}